        "content": "<report>\nHarbor Pt MOB - daily 9/25/26\nMarcus R.\n\nall crews 7-3:30 (8 hrs) unless noted\nwx: sunny, hi 79 lo 67\n\nmanpower:\nlaborers 3 guys\nkeystone 9 guys\nelectricians x8\ntidewater 6 guys\nplumbers x3\nsprinkler x4\nsummit - 6\nglassline 5 guys - left at 1 (6 hrs)\n\ndone today:\n- drywall: hung 5/8 board on corridor walls L1 west\n- plumb: pressure tested domestic water L3 east\n- roof: installed edge metal and coping Main roof\n- labor: swept and cleaned all floors, loaded dumpster L1 east\n- elec: pulled wire for lighting circuits L2 east\n\nissues:\n- lost 2 hrs - waiting on rfi 14 response, sprinkler head layout at l3 lobby ceiling\nsafety obs: ladder missing a foot found on l2; tagged out and removed\ndelivered: 5/8 in. type x gypsum board, 8 bunks from Coastal Gypsum Supply\n</report>\n\nExtract this report with record_daily_report."
